  "description": "Monvera is an elegant bold script font designed to bring a sense of luxury, charm, and modern sophistication to your designs. With its smooth flowing curves, confident strokes, and stylish letterforms, Monvera delivers a refined handwritten look that feels both timeless and contemporary.\nPerfect for branding, logos, wedding invitations, packaging, social media, product labels, and elegant typography projects, Monvera adds a graceful and premium touch to any design. Its balanced rhythm and bold presence make it ideal for headlines, signatures, and standout lettering where style and personality matter.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Monvera is an elegant bold script font designed to bring a sense of luxury, charm, and modern sophistication to your designs. With its smooth flowing curves, confident strokes, and stylish letterforms, Monvera delivers a refined handwritten look that feels both timeless and contemporary.</p>\n<p>Perfect for branding, logos, wedding invitations, packaging, social media, product labels, and elegant typography projects, Monvera adds a graceful and premium touch to any design. Its balanced rhythm and bold presence make it ideal for headlines, signatures, and standout lettering where style and personality matter.</p>",
